or run time:

  xTB (Grimme lab) — LGPL-3.0. Semi-empirical energies and forces, invoked as a
    subprocess. The container fetches the official binary release at build time.
    https://github.com/grimme-lab/xtb
  ASE (Atomic Simulation Environment) — LGPL-2.1-or-later. NEB optimizer.
    https://gitlab.com/ase/ase
